一口浊气，她站起身，摘下两个生命果，自己吃了一个，将另一个拿出生命空间捣碎，汁儿过滤出来，又回来牵引生命元素将泡在生命泉水中宝贝儿子拉过来。“熠儿，饿不饿啊？娘亲给你好吃的。”将儿子抱在怀里，战轻狂觉得心里暖暖的，看着那小嘴儿一动一动的将果汁咽下，满心欢喜。等到饭毕，就是亲子活动时间，战轻狂摸摸他宝贝儿子的小脸，拉拉小手，不停的说着。而婴儿就那样乖乖的听着，不吵不闹，圆溜溜的大眼睛一直看着他。直到小人不干了，她才不舍的将宝贝儿子放回生命泉水里，虽然不解，可是她还是听从儿子的意愿，就算可笑，只要她儿子高兴，她也乐意。看着宝贝儿子向着泉眼飘去，然后沉入水底，战轻狂担忧的喊了一声：“熠儿。”就见小人儿又浮了上来，等了半天，见她没什么事，又沉了下去，紧挨着泉眼。战轻狂这才放心，虽然好奇儿子在水里是怎么呼吸的，可是只要他没事，那她不会非得刨根问底的。将玄熠安顿在生命空间里，她放心的出来将衣服收拾好，将调料装好，其他的拿不了的就不要了。将那张入院名额拿在手里，云舒学院吗？去看看也不错。轻装上阵，战轻狂上路了，虽然她不知道该往哪里走。路上，发生了一件大事，于是，她杯具了。本想着火系灵力觉醒，那就好了，打猎什么的就不在话下了，谁知道火球术一出场，她就哭的心都有了。好好的一头野猪，愣是让她一把火烧成一块碳，不信邪的上去一碰，那叫一个樯橹灰飞烟灭啊！看来她对火球术的控制还不到家啊！所以，一路上，凡是战轻狂路过的地方，顿时一阵鸡飞狗跳。不是这只豪猪少了个耳朵，就是那只剑齿虎少了尾巴，等她一走，所有的兽兽都排排站，行注目礼，就差没泪眼朦胧挥着爪子说：你再也不要回来了，我们这辈子都不像再见到你了！这天，战轻狂总算是到了蓝城，离云舒学院不远了。而在她祸害了无数兽兽之后，火球术总算是运用自如了，并且能够通她的心意，想烧就烧，想灭就灭。进到一家酒肆，战轻狂刚坐下，就听见旁边几个男男女女的骄傲的声音。“我现在已经是高级灵师了，马上会突破了，这次去云舒学院学习，我肯定会成为一代强者的。”一个紫衣少年高傲的说。“就是，到时候我们以你马首是瞻。”另一个稍微年长的黄衣少年说。“到时候，香儿还要楚公子多多照顾呢！”一个红衣的女子娇羞的说。“好说，好说…”就在这时，楼上下来的四人嗤笑一声，立刻引得刚才说话的少年们的不满。“你什么意思？”紫衣少年寒着一张脸。“没什么意思啊，就是看不惯几只不知道天高地厚的猪在那乱叫，想笑就笑喽！”楼上下来一个锦袍公子拿着扇子不在意的说道。一番话说的几人面红耳赤。“敢说我们是…是…你不想活了？”以紫衣少年的傲气是无论如何也说不出那个字的，此时正气的浑身发抖。“我说你了吗？哎呀，真没想到，还有人找骂的。”锦袍公子的扇子摇的更欢了。“少说废话，我们上。”一言不和，紫衣少年就带人攻了上去。一时间灵力的阵法闪耀，桌椅板凳，杯碗茶碟飞得到处都是，其他人早就看苗头不对，跑了出去，唯有战轻狂还淡定的夹着菜，慢悠悠的吃着。只要不打扰她，怎么闹都行，可是，这个念头刚落下，那个黄衣的少年就被人踢到她的桌子上，打翻了所有的菜。浪费是可耻的，打扰她吃饭是不可饶恕的，此时，打架的打架，看热闹的看热闹，只有坐上的黄衣少年颤颤发抖，一动不敢动。太可怕了，那眼神……好好吃个饭被打扰，战轻狂抬头，看着这场闹剧，本以为是什么高手对决，也不过如此，一群跳梁小丑。锦袍公子和另一个人都是一星大灵师，其余两个是高级灵师；另一边只有紫衣少年是高级灵师，其余的都是中极灵师，双方差距太悬殊了，局面当然一面倒了。眼看着紫衣少年支持不住了，众人只觉的眼前飞过一道黑影，刚才还看不起别人的锦袍公子就被一脚踹飞，口吐鲜血。这一幕让众人都停下了，双方对峙，谁都不清楚这人是敌是友，可是能够一下将一星大灵师踢出去，实力不可小觑哪！“阁下，您是和他们一起的？”另一个一星大灵师抱拳，警惕的看着，刚才他就看到眼前之人独自一桌，现在怎么出手了？而阁下是对强者的称呼，表示尊敬。紫衣少年瘫倒在地，希冀的看着战轻狂。“不是。”如泉水叮咚的声音从那斗篷中传出，众人惊讶不已，这声音明明是个女人的声音，听起来年纪不大，还有着童音呢！而且大家这才发现，斗篷下的人个子不高，像个孩子一样，可是，就是这样一个孩子，却将一位大灵师踢飞，那她的等级该多高？众人的眼光已经换成敬畏了。“哦？既然不是一起的，那不知阁下是何意？”“打扰我吃饭了。”听到这话，众人嘴角抽搐。“赔钱，晶币，拿来。”说完，战轻狂伸出手。看着没人动，战轻狂有些不耐，她正要吃，就被打断，现在还饿着肚子呢！正在众人无语的时候，刚才被踢飞的锦袍公子大吼一声：“你去死吧！”就冲了上来，手中还施展了一个风刃。所有人都担心不已，可是眼中却不断冒着精光。就在这时，战轻狂一个闪身躲过，将灵力牵引到手上，火球术瞬间发射，眨眼之间，就将锦袍公子的锦袍烧了个干净，只能大白天的遛鸟，尴尬到脸都冒烟了，恨不得有个地缝儿钻进去。现场的众人憋着笑，女的则尖叫一声，背过身去，战轻狂是没有身为女人的自觉的，只见她淡定的扫了那里一眼，吐出几个字：“好丑…好小…”锦袍公子再也承受不住打击，华丽丽的气晕了，再不晕，他就没脸见人了。另一个大灵师也尴尬的不知如何是好，想说什么，不知该说什么好。还有人想为锦袍公子报仇，可是他刚动一下，就被战轻狂一个眼神给定那了，挥了挥手，一把上好的椅子就那么在众人眼下化为灰烬，风轻轻一吹，飘散到空中。震慑住了他们，战轻狂又将纤细的小手什么出，红唇轻启：“赔钱！”这下，那个大灵师痛快的拿出所有晶币，只想尽快将这煞神送走。战轻狂扫了他一眼，拿走几个晶币，就蹲到紫衣少年面前，同样伸出手。看着少年疑问的样子，战轻狂好心的解惑：“你们也有份儿，赔钱。”紫衣少年哪敢不从，将荷包中的晶币都倒在手里，见她拿了才松了一口气。站起身，她拿出两个晶币放在柜台上，“陪你的椅子钱。”没等老板说不要，就拉拉兜帽，渐渐远去，影子在太阳的照射下，逐渐拉长。直到她消失不见，酒肆才哗然，众人不停的讨论，这是哪来的强者啊……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 9 Fire Spiritual Power Returning to the cave, Zhan Qingkuang felt that he could still see the little leopard rolling in front of him, and the mother leopard looked impatient. Thinking of those few people, there was a gloom in front of my eyes. I was lucky enough to win just now. If I met a truly strong person, I might not be able to escape intact. Therefore, the most important thing is to practice spiritual power. Now that the son has been born, the spiritual power will not disappear. Thinking of this, she entered the life space and saw her precious son soaking happily with no wrinkles on his skin, so she felt relieved to practice spiritual power. Since all the meridians were surged by life elements when she gave birth, the speed and intensity of her practice now have an advantage over others, which means she is ahead of the starting line and stands on a higher basis than others. Sitting cross-legged, emptying your mind, and meditating, the life elements are pouring into your body like it's free. Fortunately, it has been developed before, and there is no pain anymore. Gradually, the life elements gather on the spiritual base, constantly rotating and rotating until they are stable, forming a head biting the tail, and the tail becomes the head. The head and tail transform into each other, just like Buddhist thought. Everything in the world is a cycle. When it reaches the end, it returns to the starting point, a new beginning. Zhan Qingkuang didn't know that at the same time she had this epiphany, the second page of the Sui Xin Book had already been opened for her. Suddenly, the rotating life elements emitted a large amount of light. When the light disappeared, the circle shape had disappeared, and was replaced by a red bead the size of a baby's fist. It was smooth and smooth. You could see the life elements inside, but it was more solid than usual, and no gaps could be seen. Looking at this, Zhan Qingkuang was surprised. The life element was obviously golden, why did it turn red now? At this time, the random book in my mind was on the second page, and it read - The Glimmer of Fire. It had been a long time since she had seen the pages of the Sui Xin Book turn. She looked at what was written on it excitedly. The first style: Fireball. The simplest method of Fire Liaoyan uses fire spiritual power to guide it into the hand for attack. The second form: the sky is full of fire and rain. On the basis of the first style, using the fireball technique to a greater extent requires spending a lot of spiritual power to form countless fireballs that fall from the sky. The third type: volcanic eruption. As the name suggests, it is like a magma explosion, used to retreat enemies in a large area, swallowing everything and turning it into ashes. The fourth form: Fire Barrier. The shield formed by fire spiritual power is used for protection. This is the only thing Zhan Qingkuang can see. Presumably the invisible parts behind are also because of her lack of ability! But she was content, at least now she could protect herself. Exhaling a breath of turbid air, she stood up, picked two life fruits, ate one herself, took the other one out of the life space and mashed it, filtered out the juice, and then came back to pull the life elements to pull her precious son soaked in the life spring water. \"Yi'er, are you hungry? Mommy will give you something delicious.\" Holding his son in his arms, Zhan Qingkuang felt warm in his heart, and he was filled with joy as he watched the little mouth move and swallow the juice. After the meal was over, it was time for parent-child activities. Zhan Qingkuang touched his precious son's little face, held his little hand, and kept talking. But the baby just listened obediently, without making any noise or fuss, and kept looking at him with his big round eyes. It wasn't until the villain quit that she reluctantly put her precious son back into the spring of life. Although she was puzzled, she still obeyed her son's wishes. Even if it was ridiculous, she would be happy as long as her son was happy. Watching his precious son float toward the spring and then sink to the bottom of the water, Zhan Qingkuang called out worriedly: \"Yi'er.\" He saw the little person floating up again. After waiting for a long time, he saw that she was fine and sank again, right next to the spring. Zhan Qingkuang felt relieved now. Although she was curious about how her son breathed in the water, as long as he was fine, she wouldn't have to get to the bottom of it. After settling Xuan Yi in her life space, she came out with peace of mind to pack her clothes and seasonings, leaving out the rest that she couldn't hold. Hold that admission quota in your hand, Yunshu College? It’s not bad to go and have a look. Traveling lightly, Zhan Qingkuang hit the road, although she didn't know where to go. On the way, a big thing happened, so she was dissatisfied. She originally thought that it would be great if her fire spiritual power awakened, and hunting would not be a problem. Who knew that as soon as the fireball technique appeared, she felt like crying. A good wild boar, if she is asked to burn it into a piece of charcoal, if she doesn't believe in evil and touches it, the gun and oar will be wiped out in ashes! It seems that she has not mastered the control of fireball yet! Therefore, wherever Zhan Qingkuang passed by along the way, there was a sudden burst of excitement. Either this porcupine was missing an ear, or the saber-toothed tiger was missing its tail. As soon as she left, all the beasts stood in line, paid attention, and waved their paws with tears in their eyes and said: You will never come back, we will never see you again in this life! On this day, Zhan Qingkuang finally arrived at Blue City, not far from Yunshu College. After she harmed countless beasts, she finally became able to use the fireball skill freely, and could understand her thoughts, burning them whenever she wanted, and destroying them whenever she wanted. Entering a wine shop, Zhan Qingkuang had just sat down when he heard the proud voices of several men and women next to him. \"I am now a senior spiritual master, and I will make a breakthrough soon. This time I go to Yunshu Academy to study, and I will definitely become a strong man.\" A young man in purple said proudly. \"That's right, we will follow your lead when the time comes.\" Another slightly older boy in yellow said. \"When the time comes, Xiang'er will still need Master Chu to take care of her!\" A woman in red said shyly. \"Easy to say, easy to say...\" At this moment, the four people who came down from upstairs sneered, which immediately aroused the dissatisfaction of the teenagers who had just spoken. \"What do you mean?\" The purple-clothed boy had a cold face. \"nothing", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}